
Method execution operations.
USAGE:

CALL <method name> [<actual paramlist>]
NOTE: <actual paramlist> ::= <actual param> | <actual param>,  <actual paramlist>

The following alias verb(s)/method(s) are available:

Call			[ In/Out ]Params&type			Status
====			=====================			======
AddPrinterConnection    [IN ]Name(STRING)                   	(null)         

CancelAllJobs           					(null)         


Pause                   					(null)         


PrintTestPage           					(null)         


RenamePrinter           [IN ]NewPrinterName(STRING)         	(null)         

Reset                   					(null)         


Resume                  					(null)         


SetDefaultPrinter       					(null)         


SetPowerState           [IN ]PowerState(UINT16)             	(null)         

			[IN ]Time(DATETIME)                 	


